This project includes material taken from oh-my-pi
(https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi), licensed under the MIT License.

Taken from it: the method of signing in to Claude and to Codex, refreshing
their tokens and reading their usage, the constants (client ids, addresses,
scopes, headers, the length of a Claude login) and the knowledge of the
payloads. The sources are:

  packages/ai/src/usage/claude.ts
  packages/ai/src/usage/openai-codex.ts
  packages/ai/src/registry/oauth/openai-codex.ts
  packages/catalog/src/compat/rules/auth/anthropic.kdl
  packages/catalog/src/compat/rules/auth/openai-codex.kdl

The code in this repository is written for Herdr's runtime and is not a copy
of oh-my-pi's code.

